      <title>高盛预计恒生指数季检将引逾125亿美元被动资金流动</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261123-104701&amp;cat=global&amp;event=evt_e9112c682079</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261123-104701:evt_e9112c682079</guid>
